<https://w3id.org/sso#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> "2026/04/04" .
<https://w3id.org/sso#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "SSO describes structural analysis models, their materials and constitutive behaviours, and the calibration events that update those behaviours against measured data."@en .
<https://w3id.org/sso#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Ontology containing the description of structural simulation models (OSAM)" .
<https://w3id.org/sso#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/format> "ttl" .
<https://w3id.org/sso#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "SSO" .
<https://w3id.org/sso#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language> "en" .
<https://w3id.org/sso#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "Universitat Politècnica de Catalunya" .
<https://w3id.org/sso#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "SSO" .
<https://w3id.org/sso#> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "sso" .
<https://w3id.org/sso#> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://w3id.org/sso#" .
<https://w3id.org/sso#> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An ontology for representing structural analysis (simulation) models and linking their finite elements to the built elements they idealize, within the O-SAM ecosystem."@en .
<https://w3id.org/sso#> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SSO — Structural Simulation Ontology"@en .
<https://w3id.org/sso#> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "0.1.0" .
