<https://w3id.org/sso#calibrated_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a calibrated entity (e.g. a Material's Elastic Behaviour, a Boundary Condition) to the Calibration event that produced this snapshot of it. Domain is intentionally open."@en .
